Z||000009||Coconut||07-03-2000||12:37 AM||||I would like to think I enjoy a fairly wide range of musical styles but am partial to Classic Rock "late 60's-70's". I can't stand Rap but Urban Contemporary R&B is great for "making the moves" on the Ladies, if ya know what I mean <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">Jazz is cool as well as a splash of World music here and there. When I'm in the Fiero it could be any of these styles. I still haven't developed a taste for Country or Opera unfortunately, but there's always a first time <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Cruisin' On,<BR>Coconut<P>------------------<BR>Larry F.<BR>Black '86 GT||||reg||7
