Z||000025||FieroGTGirl||07-03-2000||11:39 PM||||Well, <P>I prefer to rock when I am cruising.  I LOVE to drive and listen to "I can't drive 55" and even "Fly Away".  <P>Sometimes I get in these weird moods like I want to hear some good bass lines, so then I will listen to some R & B and Soul.<P>But I am a "Rocker" at heart! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Kristina_1.JPG"> ||||reg||2
