Z||000031||ThatRickGuy||07-05-2000||02:03 PM||||I'm mostly a metal head, Rammstein, Zombie, MegaDeth, Manowar, but now I'm starting to infring on the Goth/Industrial scene and my collection is growing to include And One, Nocturnia, Bauhaus, and lots more great stuff. Currently in the player is "Disturbed" a rather interesting heavy band, they have a really cool cover of the old song 'Shout' (not the old dance song, the Depechemonde one)||||reg||1
